title: >-
  AIRRPrep: validated workflows for bulk and single-cell AIRR-seq
  preprocessing
message: >-
  If you use AIRRPrep, please cite it using the metadata in this file. Cite the
  version DOI below to point at the exact code a result came from; cite the
  all-versions DOI (10.5281/zenodo.22857984) to refer to the software in
  general.
